1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"></font>

2
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"></font>

3
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kaki narase sonzai wo</b></font></font></font>

4
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>rock away your existence</b></font></font></font>

5
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>koko ni iru to</b></font></font></font>

6
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>shouting that you are here</b></font></font></font>

7
00:00:05,650 --> 00:00:11,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>arata na tabi ga ima hajimaru</b></font></font></font>

8
00:00:05,650 --> 00:00:11,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>a new journey begins now</b></font></font></font>

9
00:00:22,210 --> 00:00:28,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kawari yuku kisetsu no naka wo ikinuku tabi ni bokura</b></font></font></font>

10
00:00:22,210 --> 00:00:28,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>as we survived through the changing seasons</b></font></font></font>

11
00:00:28,170 --> 00:00:33,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>chie to tsuyosa wo te ni ireta kedo JUST LOOKS LIKE SURVIVAL GAME</b></font></font></font>

12
00:00:28,170 --> 00:00:33,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>we gained knowledge and strength (just looks like a survival game)</b></font></font></font>

13
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:36,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>nagareteku jikan no naka ni</b></font></font></font>

14
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:36,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>but the forgotten memories</b></font></font></font>

15
00:00:36,510 --> 00:00:39,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>okizari ni shita omoi wo</b></font></font></font>

16
00:00:36,510 --> 00:00:39,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>of the feelings abandoned within the flows of time</b></font></font></font>

17
00:00:39,470 --> 00:00:44,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>wasureta koto sura wasurete ita</b></font></font></font>

18
00:00:39,470 --> 00:00:44,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>have also been lost</b></font></font></font>

19
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:51,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kuzure kaketa toki kodoku wo shitte</b></font></font></font>

20
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:51,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>when sinking down we learned loneliness</b></font></font></font>

21
00:00:51,110 --> 00:00:55,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>deaeta bokura hitori ja nai</b></font></font></font>

22
00:00:51,110 --> 00:00:55,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>but now we've met each other we are no longer alone</b></font></font></font>

23
00:00:55,860 --> 00:01:01,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>sarake dase kanjou wo banjou no omoi wo</b></font></font></font>

24
00:00:55,860 --> 00:01:01,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>unveil your feelings those high emotions</b></font></font></font>

25
00:01:01,450 --> 00:01:06,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>namidame ga unmei wo kaete yuku</b></font></font></font>

26
00:01:01,450 --> 00:01:06,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>those tears will change your fate</b></font></font></font>

27
00:01:06,870 --> 00:01:09,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>yami ni uchi narase kodou wo</b></font></font></font>

28
00:01:06,870 --> 00:01:09,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>pound your heartbeat against the darkness</b></font></font></font>

29
00:01:09,790 --> 00:01:18,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>kitto aeru yo onaji itami no hata no moto de</b></font></font></font>

30
00:01:09,790 --> 00:01:18,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><b>we're sure to meet under the same flag of pain</b></font></font></font>

31
00:01:38,950 --> 00:01:43,910
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Viva Dojo Challenge!</font>

32
00:01:38,950 --> 00:01:43,910
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Explosion of Youth</font>

33
00:01:44,440 --> 00:01:48,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's been a while, hasn't it, Naruto?
Were you alone on a mission this time?</font>

34
00:01:48,920 --> 00:01:52,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I just went to deliver
Grandma Tsunade's letter.</font>

35
00:01:53,090 --> 00:01:56,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that so? Then you should report
to Tsunade-sama right away.</font>

36
00:01:56,800 --> 00:01:58,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know!</font>

37
00:01:59,510 --> 00:02:02,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've only been away for a week,</font>

38
00:02:02,310 --> 00:02:04,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but it seems as though
an awful lot has changed.</font>

39
00:02:05,810 --> 00:02:09,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}{"DOJO CHALLENGERS, COME THIS WAY"</b></font>

40
00:02:08,100 --> 00:02:09,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That sign wasn't here before, either.</font>

41
00:02:10,150 --> 00:02:11,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Dojo challenge?</font>

42
00:02:15,990 --> 00:02:18,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}"MAKE-OUT VIOLENCE 3"</b></font>

43
00:02:19,910 --> 00:02:21,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This way?</font>

44
00:02:25,080 --> 00:02:26,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is a tight squeeze.</font>

45
00:02:27,040 --> 00:02:28,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that it?</font>

46
00:02:28,670 --> 00:02:36,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}"PASSION DOJO"</b></font>

47
00:02:29,750 --> 00:02:33,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"Passion Dojo"
Who on earth built this?</font>

48
00:02:37,760 --> 00:02:38,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've been waiting for you!</font>

49
00:02:40,180 --> 00:02:41,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've come here
for a dojo challenge, right?</font>

50
00:02:43,550 --> 00:02:46,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, then.
Come at me from anywhere you like!</font>

51
00:02:47,100 --> 00:02:49,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? Bushy Brow?</font>

52
00:02:49,810 --> 00:02:52,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you don't make a move,
I'm coming at you!</font>

53
00:02:52,440 --> 00:02:53,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? Wait, hold it.</font>

54
00:02:54,070 --> 00:02:56,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, it's me!
It's only me, Bushy Brow!</font>

55
00:02:59,950 --> 00:03:01,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

56
00:03:02,570 --> 00:03:05,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, that was close, I tell you!</font>

57
00:03:05,160 --> 00:03:08,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, the first dojo challenger
will be you, Naruto!</font>

58
00:03:08,410 --> 00:03:10,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, I couldn't wish
for a better opponent!</font>

59
00:03:11,540 --> 00:03:13,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to go at this for real!</font>

60
00:03:13,960 --> 00:03:15,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait just a minute!</font>

61
00:03:15,630 --> 00:03:16,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leaf Hurricane!</font>

62
00:03:21,510 --> 00:03:22,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here.</font>

63
00:03:23,180 --> 00:03:24,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, you just came to view the grounds?</font>

64
00:03:25,970 --> 00:03:29,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then you should have said so
in the first place.</font>

65
00:03:30,730 --> 00:03:35,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I never even got a chance to tell you.
You just suddenly attacked me.</font>

66
00:03:35,610 --> 00:03:38,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm really sorry about that.</font>

67
00:03:38,440 --> 00:03:42,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Say. Is this dojo yours, Bushy Brow?</font>

68
00:03:43,160 --> 00:03:46,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes. I have been working on it
for quite some time</font>

69
00:03:46,490 --> 00:03:48,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and finally completed it six days ago.</font>

70
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:52,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This flyer was distributed
not only in Hidden Leaf Village,</font>

71
00:03:52,960 --> 00:03:55,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but in all the nearby towns
and villages as well.</font>

72
00:03:55,250 --> 00:03:56,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You don't say?</font>

73
00:03:56,790 --> 00:04:00,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've been away on a mission
and have only just returned.</font>

74
00:04:00,470 --> 00:04:01,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that so?</font>

75
00:04:01,550 --> 00:04:04,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But why a dojo?</font>

76
00:04:04,300 --> 00:04:06,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's all for training.</font>

77
00:04:07,350 --> 00:04:08,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For training?</font>

78
00:04:09,560 --> 00:04:12,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, actually, I've been busy
with missions lately</font>

79
00:04:12,480 --> 00:04:15,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and have not been able to set aside
as much time for training as I'd like to.</font>

80
00:04:16,980 --> 00:04:18,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And even on those occasions
when I was able to take time out,</font>

81
00:04:18,820 --> 00:04:23,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it was hard to find practice partners,
so I wasn't able to train efficiently.</font>

82
00:04:26,570 --> 00:04:28,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just when I was wondering
what I ought to do about it,</font>

83
00:04:28,830 --> 00:04:31,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I saw something in a village
I visited on a mission.</font>

84
00:04:34,040 --> 00:04:35,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I request a challenge!</font>

85
00:04:38,170 --> 00:04:39,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please come this way.</font>

86
00:04:39,800 --> 00:04:40,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay.</font>

87
00:04:44,050 --> 00:04:47,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have travelled near and far
in search of training.</font>

88
00:04:48,810 --> 00:04:50,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'd like to have a practice match.</font>

89
00:04:51,310 --> 00:04:55,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But if I should win,
I'll claim your marquee.</font>

90
00:04:55,770 --> 00:05:00,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A dojo challenge, huh?
Very well, I shall have a match with you.</font>

91
00:05:03,240 --> 00:05:04,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here I come!</font>

92
00:05:08,240 --> 00:05:10,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I were to open my own dojo,</font>

93
00:05:10,580 --> 00:05:14,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">someone with confidence in his skills
will surely come to challenge me!</font>

94
00:05:15,500 --> 00:05:21,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, I opened the dojo thinking
it would give me good practice,</font>

95
00:05:21,300 --> 00:05:24,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but nobody has come
to challenge me yet.</font>

96
00:05:27,090 --> 00:05:28,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that so?</font>

97
00:05:32,520 --> 00:05:36,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Say, since you're here, Naruto,
won't you try out for a dojo challenge?</font>

98
00:05:37,650 --> 00:05:40,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you win,
I'll give you the sign I painted myself.</font>

99
00:05:40,610 --> 00:05:42,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have no need for such things.</font>

100
00:05:42,820 --> 00:05:45,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't say that!
Please, by all means!</font>

101
00:05:48,240 --> 00:05:52,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come to think of it,
I forgot to report to Grandma Tsunade!</font>

102
00:05:52,540 --> 00:05:53,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'd better go right away!</font>

103
00:05:53,910 --> 00:05:55,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">See you later!</font>

104
00:05:56,080 --> 00:05:57,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

105
00:05:57,540 --> 00:06:00,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please be my first!</font>

106
00:06:01,960 --> 00:06:05,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it. I wasted so much time,
thanks to Bushy Brow.</font>

107
00:06:05,340 --> 00:06:07,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Grandma Tsunade scolded me to bits.</font>

108
00:06:08,380 --> 00:06:12,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'd better steer clear
of Bushy Brow's Dojo for the time being.</font>

109
00:06:12,850 --> 00:06:14,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's that I hear about Lee's Dojo?</font>

110
00:06:15,560 --> 00:06:17,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Intense Brow Sensei?</font>

111
00:06:18,810 --> 00:06:21,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, what do you mean by that?</font>

112
00:06:23,610 --> 00:06:28,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you mean to tell me
that he opened a dojo to train himself</font>

113
00:06:28,150 --> 00:06:31,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">while I was away from the village
on a mission?</font>

114
00:06:33,240 --> 00:06:35,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Splendid, if I may say so
about my own student!</font>

115
00:06:35,370 --> 00:06:39,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I, Might Guy, am impressed and moved!</font>

116
00:06:41,040 --> 00:06:44,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But the all-important dojo challengers
have yet to appear. Not a single one.</font>

117
00:06:46,630 --> 00:06:49,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn those dojo challengers!</font>

118
00:06:49,340 --> 00:06:51,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think that Lee's earnest hopes
have come to naught.</font>

119
00:06:51,890 --> 00:06:55,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll search high and low and give them
a hit they cannot forget!</font>

120
00:06:56,140 --> 00:06:57,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, if you do that,</font>

121
00:06:57,600 --> 00:07:00,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you'll just make even less people want
to visit for a challenge.</font>

122
00:07:00,690 --> 00:07:04,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ah, that's right.
Whatever shall I do, then?!</font>

123
00:07:07,320 --> 00:07:10,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've got it. If no one comes
to challenge his dojo, then...</font>

124
00:07:12,410 --> 00:07:18,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why don't I myself go to Lee's Dojo,
disguised as a dojo challenger?</font>

125
00:07:19,500 --> 00:07:23,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll play the part of Lee's first!</font>

126
00:07:32,590 --> 00:07:34,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A perfect disguise, if I do say so myself.</font>

127
00:07:35,220 --> 00:07:37,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He wouldn't dream
that this was me, no way.</font>

128
00:07:38,810 --> 00:07:41,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here I come, Lee.</font>

129
00:07:41,140 --> 00:07:42,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Guy-sensei!</font>

130
00:07:45,650 --> 00:07:47,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I finally found you.</font>

131
00:07:47,360 --> 00:07:50,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If it isn't Sakura! What's going on?</font>

132
00:07:51,280 --> 00:07:55,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Guy, forgive me for bothering you
when you've only just returned, but...</font>

133
00:07:55,620 --> 00:07:58,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">an emergency relief request has come in
from Shikamaru's squad,</font>

134
00:07:58,620 --> 00:08:00,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">which was assigned
to transport unit duty.</font>

135
00:08:02,000 --> 00:08:05,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We know nothing whatsoever about
the true nature and scale of the enemy.</font>

136
00:08:05,540 --> 00:08:06,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Therefore,</font>

137
00:08:06,840 --> 00:08:08,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there is a possibility of this developing
into something major</font>

138
00:08:08,750 --> 00:08:11,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if we err in our initial encounter.</font>

139
00:08:12,010 --> 00:08:14,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Judging from reports,
they should be around here.</font>

140
00:08:15,510 --> 00:08:16,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're close by.</font>

141
00:08:17,260 --> 00:08:19,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">First, you go reconnoiter
to confirm the situation.</font>

142
00:08:20,560 --> 00:08:24,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If they seem to need additional relief,
I will make immediate arrangements.</font>

143
00:08:24,940 --> 00:08:26,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, roger that.</font>

144
00:08:31,740 --> 00:08:34,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Can that strange getup have
some significance?</font>

145
00:08:36,740 --> 00:08:37,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know.</font>

146
00:08:44,080 --> 00:08:46,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's with that strange fellow?</font>

147
00:08:46,710 --> 00:08:50,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, no matter.
I'll borrow his form</font>

148
00:08:50,710 --> 00:08:52,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to infiltrate Leaf Village.</font>

149
00:08:56,970 --> 00:08:59,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Village Hidden
in the Leaves' secrets...</font>

150
00:08:59,560 --> 00:09:02,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I, Nanafushi,
shall investigate every last detail!</font>

151
00:09:04,390 --> 00:09:07,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Was that guy really looking
for a dojo challenge?</font>

152
00:09:08,020 --> 00:09:11,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah. That's what he claimed to be,
so there can be no doubt.</font>

153
00:09:11,610 --> 00:09:13,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He says he came
because he saw the flyers.</font>

154
00:09:13,690 --> 00:09:15,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder if he got lost or something.</font>

155
00:09:16,910 --> 00:09:20,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Intense Brow Sensei, how long
do you intend to keep us waiting?</font>

156
00:09:22,120 --> 00:09:26,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, I think, after all, I'd like
to have you be a dojo challenger.</font>

157
00:09:30,090 --> 00:09:31,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, no.</font>

158
00:09:31,340 --> 00:09:33,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll go look for him!</font>

159
00:09:34,220 --> 00:09:35,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

160
00:09:35,720 --> 00:09:38,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Work up a youthful sweat with me!</font>

161
00:09:40,930 --> 00:09:42,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, he returned after all.</font>

162
00:09:43,140 --> 00:09:45,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I knew that getup would be problematic.</font>

163
00:09:46,060 --> 00:09:49,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? What's the problem?</font>

164
00:09:52,690 --> 00:09:56,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sensei...?
What's with the strange disguise?</font>

165
00:09:56,360 --> 00:09:57,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everyone can still tell it's you!</font>

166
00:09:59,410 --> 00:10:02,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I... I didn't think it was
such a great idea, either.</font>

167
00:10:04,040 --> 00:10:05,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the matter?</font>

168
00:10:06,210 --> 00:10:09,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't tell me these guys have discovered
my true identify!</font>

169
00:10:10,170 --> 00:10:11,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Intense Brow Sensei!</font>

170
00:10:12,550 --> 00:10:14,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sensei!</font>

171
00:10:14,880 --> 00:10:19,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Quit delaying
and get over to Lee's Dojo!</font>

172
00:10:19,050 --> 00:10:19,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

173
00:10:19,800 --> 00:10:23,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you don't go, then I'll have
to fight him! Come on!</font>

174
00:10:24,720 --> 00:10:26,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Be seeing you!</font>

175
00:10:26,680 --> 00:10:28,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I guess you could say...</font>

176
00:10:28,520 --> 00:10:29,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's typical of him.</font>

177
00:10:31,310 --> 00:10:33,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm safe, thanks to this guy.</font>

178
00:10:33,820 --> 00:10:37,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I should attach myself to him for a while
and scope out the village's situation.</font>

179
00:10:41,410 --> 00:10:42,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is this place?</font>

180
00:10:42,580 --> 00:10:44,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is Lee's Dojo!</font>

181
00:10:45,200 --> 00:10:49,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, really, couldn't you have come up
with a little better disguise?</font>

182
00:10:50,120 --> 00:10:52,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, never mind!</font>

183
00:10:52,080 --> 00:10:55,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee must be tired of waiting,
so try to do a good acting job!</font>

184
00:10:56,050 --> 00:10:58,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Acting? What is he talking about?</font>

185
00:11:00,130 --> 00:11:02,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've brought him with me, Bushy Brow!</font>

186
00:11:04,510 --> 00:11:05,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've been waiting for you!</font>

187
00:11:06,390 --> 00:11:09,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, then, please try
to take down my dojo!</font>

188
00:11:10,230 --> 00:11:11,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

189
00:11:12,610 --> 00:11:14,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please come this way!</font>

190
00:11:14,320 --> 00:11:16,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Um... Um...</font>

191
00:11:16,780 --> 00:11:20,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At this time, you're supposed to say,
"I request a challenge match" right?</font>

192
00:11:20,950 --> 00:11:22,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see.</font>

193
00:11:23,070 --> 00:11:25,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I request a challenge match!</font>

194
00:11:25,160 --> 00:11:29,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do I hear that familiar call?
You indeed are a dojo challenger!</font>

195
00:11:30,370 --> 00:11:35,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fair enough! If you win,
you can have my marquee!</font>

196
00:11:36,460 --> 00:11:40,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Could it be that I've been mistaken
for a dojo challenger?</font>

197
00:11:41,300 --> 00:11:42,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, my God.</font>

198
00:11:44,470 --> 00:11:45,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's just a kid.</font>

199
00:11:46,100 --> 00:11:49,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, it can't be helped.
I'll go easy on him.</font>

200
00:11:50,100 --> 00:11:51,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay! Here I come!</font>

201
00:11:51,980 --> 00:11:53,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ready!</font>

202
00:11:53,600 --> 00:11:54,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He disappeared?</font>

203
00:11:57,980 --> 00:11:59,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

204
00:12:00,320 --> 00:12:01,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What happened?</font>

205
00:12:06,240 --> 00:12:07,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This little brat!</font>

206
00:12:08,990 --> 00:12:11,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take that! And that!
And this! And that!</font>

207
00:12:11,750 --> 00:12:12,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's strong!</font>

208
00:12:16,630 --> 00:12:18,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's going on?!</font>

209
00:12:19,050 --> 00:12:23,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know you're acting, but you're still
giving him too much of a break, Sensei.</font>

210
00:12:25,300 --> 00:12:28,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, I see. He's not fighting back
because it'll ruin his disguise!</font>

211
00:12:31,930 --> 00:12:36,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if I had nine lives,
I'd never survive this fellow.</font>

212
00:12:37,110 --> 00:12:40,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I think I'd better wave a white flag
and withdraw here.</font>

213
00:12:42,360 --> 00:12:44,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I concede.</font>

214
00:12:46,410 --> 00:12:49,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then that means... I did it!</font>

215
00:12:49,200 --> 00:12:52,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I splendidly fought off
my first dojo challenger!</font>

216
00:12:52,450 --> 00:12:53,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, that's not it at all!</font>

217
00:12:55,420 --> 00:12:57,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What he means by "concede"</font>

218
00:12:57,460 --> 00:13:00,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is that he concedes
to be a dojo challenger, right?</font>

219
00:13:01,880 --> 00:13:04,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words,
he's just been warming up,</font>

220
00:13:04,880 --> 00:13:07,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and now comes
the real challenge, right?</font>

221
00:13:09,430 --> 00:13:11,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, that's not it at all!</font>

222
00:13:11,350 --> 00:13:13,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, that's what you meant, after all.</font>

223
00:13:14,980 --> 00:13:16,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I thought it was odd</font>

224
00:13:16,850 --> 00:13:20,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that an experienced dojo challenger
would surrender.</font>

225
00:13:20,570 --> 00:13:23,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not odd!
There's nothing odd about it at all!</font>

226
00:13:23,110 --> 00:13:26,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, then, I'll have to really get down
to business now, too!</font>

227
00:13:26,740 --> 00:13:30,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?! You mean you haven't
even really gotten started yet?</font>

228
00:13:32,450 --> 00:13:36,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Intense Brow Sensei is
a pretty good actor!</font>

229
00:13:38,000 --> 00:13:42,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's even taking more hits
so that Bushy Brow won't know it's him.</font>

230
00:13:44,010 --> 00:13:47,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? You were only attacked by monkeys?</font>

231
00:13:48,050 --> 00:13:50,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They were after the snacks
that Choji procured,</font>

232
00:13:51,060 --> 00:13:52,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but the important load is safe!</font>

233
00:13:54,390 --> 00:13:56,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My snacks... by a monkey.</font>

234
00:13:57,060 --> 00:14:00,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ino mistook that
for an enemy's attack</font>

235
00:14:00,900 --> 00:14:02,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and sent out
an emergency relief request.</font>

236
00:14:02,610 --> 00:14:04,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But it was so sudden!</font>

237
00:14:04,690 --> 00:14:08,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Anyway, it's your fault
for procuring so many snacks!</font>

238
00:14:08,660 --> 00:14:10,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">These snacks were available
for a limited time,</font>

239
00:14:10,700 --> 00:14:12,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and moreover,
only available in the Land of Tea,</font>

240
00:14:12,660 --> 00:14:15,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Super-rare
"Green tea Pork-flavored" chips!</font>

241
00:14:15,700 --> 00:14:18,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For a snack lover, it is the ultimate sin
to refrain from buying</font>

242
00:14:18,830 --> 00:14:21,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">a limited offering of snacks
once one has found them!</font>

243
00:14:21,340 --> 00:14:23,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Like I care about stuff like that!</font>

244
00:14:23,300 --> 00:14:25,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— What?
— What?!</font>

245
00:14:27,880 --> 00:14:30,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shikamaru, things are tough for you,
aren't they?</font>

246
00:14:31,300 --> 00:14:34,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right back at you. That getup...
Did something happen?</font>

247
00:14:35,970 --> 00:14:38,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What about my getup?</font>

248
00:14:39,100 --> 00:14:40,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here.</font>

249
00:14:41,520 --> 00:14:44,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, that's right!
I haven't got time for dallying here!</font>

250
00:14:44,940 --> 00:14:46,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've got to get over to Lee's dojo!</font>

251
00:14:46,820 --> 00:14:48,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just wait for me, Lee!</font>

252
00:14:56,080 --> 00:14:59,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're overdoing it
on purposefully getting beaten, Sensei.</font>

253
00:15:04,380 --> 00:15:06,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is he finished now?</font>

254
00:15:06,170 --> 00:15:07,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Whoa, hold it! Time out!</font>

255
00:15:11,800 --> 00:15:13,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fight back a little, will you?!</font>

256
00:15:14,390 --> 00:15:16,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's impossible, I tell you.</font>

257
00:15:17,020 --> 00:15:19,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If Lee doesn't find
this challenging enough,</font>

258
00:15:19,140 --> 00:15:22,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I might get stuck being his opponent.</font>

259
00:15:22,770 --> 00:15:24,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Actually...</font>

260
00:15:24,860 --> 00:15:27,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it's been one extreme mission
after another lately</font>

261
00:15:27,480 --> 00:15:29,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and I haven't gotten any sleep at all.</font>

262
00:15:29,240 --> 00:15:31,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? You don't say.</font>

263
00:15:31,410 --> 00:15:34,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I got a little rest,
I think I might recover, but...</font>

264
00:15:36,620 --> 00:15:40,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">While I take a rest,
won't you be his opponent for a while?</font>

265
00:15:41,040 --> 00:15:42,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

266
00:15:42,330 --> 00:15:43,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm begging you!</font>

267
00:15:45,880 --> 00:15:47,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is that?</font>

268
00:15:47,840 --> 00:15:49,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm coming, Lee!</font>

269
00:15:51,510 --> 00:15:52,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Guy?</font>

270
00:15:53,180 --> 00:15:55,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I thought he already entered the village
a while ago.</font>

271
00:15:57,510 --> 00:15:59,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry to keep you waiting!</font>

272
00:16:00,680 --> 00:16:04,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've weathered such an attack
and you're still undamaged.</font>

273
00:16:04,860 --> 00:16:06,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're quite a fellow!</font>

274
00:16:06,650 --> 00:16:08,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The world is vast...</font>

275
00:16:08,280 --> 00:16:10,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think that such
an awesome dojo challenger exists!</font>

276
00:16:10,940 --> 00:16:13,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was worth building this dojo!</font>

277
00:16:13,860 --> 00:16:17,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no way I could win
with only Taijutsu!</font>

278
00:16:18,080 --> 00:16:20,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If that's the case,
then I'll fight my own way.</font>

279
00:16:21,160 --> 00:16:22,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here I come!</font>

280
00:16:22,580 --> 00:16:24,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

281
00:16:25,710 --> 00:16:29,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But of course! He's well acquainted
with Ninjutsu too!</font>

282
00:16:29,630 --> 00:16:31,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leaf Hurricane!</font>

283
00:16:32,170 --> 00:16:33,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The real body is... right above me!</font>

284
00:16:37,640 --> 00:16:39,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Primary Lotus!</font>

285
00:16:42,980 --> 00:16:44,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is this a clone, too?</font>

286
00:16:46,690 --> 00:16:47,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Got you!</font>

287
00:16:49,320 --> 00:16:50,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here I go, one more time!</font>

288
00:16:51,240 --> 00:16:52,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Another Shadow Clone?</font>

289
00:16:53,360 --> 00:16:54,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nope!</font>

290
00:16:55,530 --> 00:16:56,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop it, Lee.</font>

291
00:16:57,910 --> 00:16:59,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura?</font>

292
00:16:59,370 --> 00:17:01,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Be nice, now!
— Don't be too hard on me.</font>

293
00:17:01,790 --> 00:17:03,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Please!
— Don't be mean!</font>

294
00:17:04,080 --> 00:17:08,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So many Sakura...
Guy-sensei! I'm moved!</font>

295
00:17:09,380 --> 00:17:12,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've never known such happiness before
in my life!</font>

296
00:17:12,300 --> 00:17:13,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shannaro!</font>

297
00:17:14,010 --> 00:17:15,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wha...?</font>

298
00:17:16,890 --> 00:17:18,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We did it!</font>

299
00:17:20,930 --> 00:17:24,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I guess I forgot...
that this is a fight with a challenger.</font>

300
00:17:25,020 --> 00:17:28,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just as one might expect...
But I won't fall for the same trick again!</font>

301
00:17:29,060 --> 00:17:33,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even though they may look like Sakura,
they're really just phony Transformation!</font>

302
00:17:33,940 --> 00:17:36,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How can you say that, Lee?</font>

303
00:17:37,030 --> 00:17:39,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurry back, Sensei!</font>

304
00:17:40,490 --> 00:17:45,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For brats,
they fight such a high-level fight.</font>

305
00:17:46,250 --> 00:17:48,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Leave it to Village Hidden in Leafs.
— How about this?!</font>

306
00:17:48,500 --> 00:17:51,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder if the rumors
that they lost its vigor were just lies?</font>

307
00:17:51,750 --> 00:17:55,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I guess I need
to investigate this further.</font>

308
00:17:56,680 --> 00:17:58,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This disguise is problematic.</font>

309
00:17:58,640 --> 00:18:01,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I get a feeling
I will be embroiled in trouble again.</font>

310
00:18:04,980 --> 00:18:07,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go with this.
Well, then, shall I be taking my leave?</font>

311
00:18:09,310 --> 00:18:10,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hold it right there!</font>

312
00:18:11,940 --> 00:18:13,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The real thing!</font>

313
00:18:13,280 --> 00:18:16,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see that you are Rock Lee,
master of this dojo.</font>

314
00:18:17,110 --> 00:18:20,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, no. I guess
I'll have to play along with him.</font>

315
00:18:21,030 --> 00:18:25,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, indeed. I am Rock Lee,
master of this dojo.</font>

316
00:18:27,580 --> 00:18:31,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am a dojo challenger!</font>

317
00:18:32,000 --> 00:18:36,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rock Lee, I shall defeat you
and claim your marquee!</font>

318
00:18:37,760 --> 00:18:38,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here I come!</font>

319
00:18:47,390 --> 00:18:49,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You fight a pretty good fight.</font>

320
00:18:49,350 --> 00:18:50,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You, too.</font>

321
00:18:55,070 --> 00:18:56,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Help!</font>

322
00:18:57,280 --> 00:18:58,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bushy Brow?!</font>

323
00:18:59,570 --> 00:19:01,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Dynamic Entry!</font>

324
00:19:04,030 --> 00:19:06,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Another dojo challenger?!</font>

325
00:19:06,910 --> 00:19:09,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Intense Brow Sensei!
What took you so long?!</font>

326
00:19:11,380 --> 00:19:15,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto... what's the meaning of this?</font>

327
00:19:15,800 --> 00:19:18,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you can't dodge
even this much of an attack,</font>

328
00:19:18,670 --> 00:19:19,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you are not worth all the talk!</font>

329
00:19:19,840 --> 00:19:22,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your training is inadequate!</font>

330
00:19:22,840 --> 00:19:25,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No... This is... I mean...</font>

331
00:19:25,680 --> 00:19:29,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's about a million years too early
for you to be building your own dojo!</font>

332
00:19:29,310 --> 00:19:34,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I must straighten that spoiled attitude
of yours with my own fist!</font>

333
00:19:39,320 --> 00:19:42,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Forgive me, Lee.
It's my whip of love!</font>

334
00:19:43,070 --> 00:19:46,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, the true identity of the challenger
was you, Guy-sensei!</font>

335
00:19:47,200 --> 00:19:52,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? You're Lee?
Then, who was I punching?</font>

336
00:19:56,920 --> 00:19:58,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who's that guy?</font>

337
00:20:00,880 --> 00:20:02,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good grief.</font>

338
00:20:05,100 --> 00:20:07,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come in! Oh, it's you, Guy.</font>

339
00:20:08,810 --> 00:20:10,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And you're with Naruto and Lee.</font>

340
00:20:10,640 --> 00:20:14,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's perfect.
I was just about to call you all.</font>

341
00:20:15,310 --> 00:20:17,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Has something happened?</font>

342
00:20:17,770 --> 00:20:19,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just now, some intelligence came in.</font>

343
00:20:20,400 --> 00:20:22,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A Shinobi from the Land of Valleys,
by the name of Nanafushi,</font>

344
00:20:22,820 --> 00:20:25,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is said to have been seeking
inside information on our village.</font>

345
00:20:26,950 --> 00:20:29,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He may already have infiltrated
the village.</font>

346
00:20:29,700 --> 00:20:34,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want you to go search for this Nanafushi
immediately and capture him.</font>

347
00:20:38,040 --> 00:20:39,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That man...</font>

348
00:20:39,630 --> 00:20:41,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You have an idea of where he might be?</font>

349
00:20:41,470 --> 00:20:42,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— It's this guy!
— It's this man!</font>

350
00:20:47,680 --> 00:20:51,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't really know what's going on,
but our mission is complete!</font>

351
00:20:52,180 --> 00:20:54,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, then, we'll be going.</font>

352
00:20:54,190 --> 00:20:56,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Don't just leave him here!</font>

353
00:20:57,110 --> 00:20:58,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Guy-senpai!</font>

354
00:20:58,480 --> 00:21:04,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Explain what happened!
Hey! Lee! Hey! Naruto!</font>

355
00:21:29,380 --> 00:21:31,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Comic Sans MS"><b><font size="26"><font color="#cfd4e2">hoshikuzu suchasucha sucha odoru</font></font></b></font></font>

356
